	<notes>
		<note id="16" x="40" y="40" w="400" h="140">OBT and optimization (left): denormalized analytics. obt_transaction_enriched is built from fact_transactions and the dimensions (ETL lineage, builder only, no validator rule), so it has no relationship line.</note>
		<note id="17" x="480" y="40" w="600" h="170">Dimensional core (centre): star schema / fact constellation, 5 dimensions and 3 facts. dim_account and dim_device reference dim_user (outriggers). Lines are DBeaver VIRTUAL foreign keys: workspace metadata only. Delta declares no primary or foreign key, and no constraint exists in Trino or GCS.</note>
		<note id="18" x="1960" y="40" w="860" h="110">Feature tables (right): point-in-time features. Their lines are validated key references to a dimension, not the aggregation lineage they are computed from.</note>
	</notes>
